*> vybe-test: cobol/pic_clauses/test_pic_edited_alphanumeric
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_pic_clauses.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-EDIT-B PIC X(3)BX(3) VALUE SPACES.
01 WS-EDIT-SLASH PIC X(2)/X(2) VALUE SPACES.
01 WS-EDIT-DATE PIC 99/99/99 VALUE ZERO.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    MOVE "ABCDEF" TO WS-EDIT-B.
    DISPLAY WS-EDIT-B.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-EDIT-B DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "ABC DEF"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [ABC DEF] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    MOVE "0115" TO WS-EDIT-SLASH.
    DISPLAY WS-EDIT-SLASH.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-EDIT-SLASH DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "01/15"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [01/15] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    MOVE 010203 TO WS-EDIT-DATE.
    DISPLAY WS-EDIT-DATE.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-EDIT-DATE DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "01/02/03"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [01/02/03] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

